    "detailed_description": "I am a magic helper doll. I was given to Vasilisa by her mother before she died. If you feed me and say the right words, I come to life and help my mistress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101110/extras/e7d8239c3819e49a7b5ce4bb23801c6b.avif?t=1744219312\" width=616 height=142 /></span><br>After the death of his wife, Vasilisa's father grieved and grieved, but ended up remarrying. The stepmother does not like Vasilisa, every day she makes her do a lot of housework. Vasilisa feeds me in the evenings, and I help her. I do the work and at night I watch out for evil in the house. And there's actually a lot of evil around the stepmother's house!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101110/extras/5641f10e6782eb2a9bfb570b996f2d2c.avif?t=1744219312\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101110/extras/9b081e7a6217958c1ab3d4bfa9db7e82.avif?t=1744219312\" width=616 height=142 /></span><br>An action adventure game in which you, as a magic doll, will fight evil spirits at night. You will be met by malicious opponents - a bannik, a ovinnik and a kikimora. Find a way to defeat them in a fair fight and teach them a lesson so that they will remember it for a long time!<br><br>\u2022 Explore the yard, the wheat field and the river bank<br>\u2022 Collect a collection of strange objects<br>\u2022 Learn more about the evil spirits that live in the area<br>\u2022 And teach these evil spirits a lesson!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101110/extras/e7d8239c3819e49a7b5ce4bb23801c6b.avif?t=1744219312\" width=616 height=142 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "I am a magic helper doll. I was given to Vasilisa by her mother before she died. If you feed me and say the right words, I come to life and help my mistress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101110/extras/e7d8239c3819e49a7b5ce4bb23801c6b.avif?t=1744219312\" width=616 height=142 /></span><br>After the death of his wife, Vasilisa's father grieved and grieved, but ended up remarrying. The stepmother does not like Vasilisa, every day she makes her do a lot of housework. Vasilisa feeds me in the evenings, and I help her. I do the work and at night I watch out for evil in the house. And there's actually a lot of evil around the stepmother's house!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101110/extras/5641f10e6782eb2a9bfb570b996f2d2c.avif?t=1744219312\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101110/extras/9b081e7a6217958c1ab3d4bfa9db7e82.avif?t=1744219312\" width=616 height=142 /></span><br>An action adventure game in which you, as a magic doll, will fight evil spirits at night. You will be met by malicious opponents - a bannik, a ovinnik and a kikimora. Find a way to defeat them in a fair fight and teach them a lesson so that they will remember it for a long time!<br><br>\u2022 Explore the yard, the wheat field and the river bank<br>\u2022 Collect a collection of strange objects<br>\u2022 Learn more about the evil spirits that live in the area<br>\u2022 And teach these evil spirits a lesson!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101110/extras/e7d8239c3819e49a7b5ce4bb23801c6b.avif?t=1744219312\" width=616 height=142 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Level up the magical assistant doll Vasilisa the Beautiful from the famous fairy tale, who fights evil spirits at night, so that later the path to Baba Yaga will be easier!",
